ind":"announcement","title":"Demo Bug Fixes - Version 0.0.12.4","summary":"Passes count did not update when passes were used.Remove passes option was not working when mousing over the passes.Guest were violating inn policy by taking soda back to their rooms without drinking them.Guest were loitering around the soda bar without ordering anything, annoying staff and developers.A few grammar corrections.Able to soft lock by trying to look at your inventory on the train and hitting a cutsceneSome players report crashes at begging of game when choosing their burial outfit t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:27:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030497","verified_at":"2026-10-21T23:32:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661090-1842846814444006","game_id":"steam-4661090","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3 - A-MEAN-able Amenities","summary":"Greetings Spooky Friends! As we count down the final days of summer, we're checking the weather forecast for the first days of fall weather. I've been hard at work making building ghost, rooms, and features. Today's devlog will go over a few of them. And we've got some big news: Inn Kreeper is participating in Steam Next Fest this October!THE SODA BARThe Soda Bar allows you to serve strawberry and apple sodas to your guests with their free Soda Bar pass. Now, while this may sound like a pleasant","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T16:50:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814444006","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661090-1837955055364187","game_id":"steam-4661090","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2 - What's cooking?","summary":"Hello again!This summer has been incredibly warm, as I'm sure many of you have experienced. I've retreated to my basement to escape the heat and put the finishing touches on some new features for Inn Kreeper.Here's what's cooking.Inn Kreeper originally began as a game jam project I made for Halloween. It was a much simpler version of what the game has become today, but one mechanic survived all the way from that first prototype: room service.Screenshot from Game Jam prototype:I've redesigned thi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T18:39:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055364187","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4661090-1834602721202900","game_id":"steam-4661090","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1 — Welcome to the Inn!","summary":"Hello everyone! I'm the solo indie dev behind Inn Kreeper, a cozy‑horror management sim where you run a spooky mountain inn, terrify your guests (just a little), and collect the ghosts they leave behind.I’ve been quietly building the game for a while, and now that the Steam page is live, we’re excited to start sharing more about the world, the characters, and the strange little systems that make the inn come alive.What is Inn Kreeper?You play as The Kreeper, an undead homebody who would honestly","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T20:12:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721202900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:55:52Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4661090":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:51Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T03:18:51Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4661090":"2026-10-26T03:18:51Z"},"notices":[],"news_s